# Volcanic Mine: ore packs as the reward, access learnt as paid for good, a game ended by the
# eruption and one by logging out, each kept with how it ended.
#
# Facts (OSRS wiki, Volcanic Mine; Ore pack (Volcanic Mine); Death):
#  - "Ore packs are an item purchased from the Volcanic Mine reward shop for 4,000 points."
#  - "A one-time fee of 3,000 numulite can also be paid for permanent access."
#  - "After 10 minutes have elapsed, the volcano will erupt and anyone still in the volcano will die."
#  - "Oh dear, you are dead!" (Death)
# RuneLite: the mine is regions 15263 and 15262 (Discord plugin); the entrance at 3812, 3810
# (world map). The scene is schematic.
volcanic reward ORE_PACK
scene 3760 3760
at 3812 3808
npc FOSSIL_MINEGUARD "Petrified Pete" 3815 3812 as pete
skill MINING 80
widget FossilVolcanicShop.POINTS text "Points: 9,000"
tick
expect stat.Points = "9,000"
expect goal = "1000/4000"
expect goal.note ~ "2 packs affordable now. 3,000 points to the next pack."
# Ore packs are bought again and again: the card says how many, the step stays on the game.
expect step = "Bring 30 numulite"
close FossilVolcanicShop.POINTS
# No numulite carried, yet in: access paid for good.
tick
scene 3760 10140
at 3800 10190
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_PROGRESS_STATUS 2
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_TEMP_PTS 0
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_NUMBERPLAYERS 1
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_CURRENT_STABILITY 60
tick
expect saved.volcanic.owned ~ "A"
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_TEMP_PTS 1500
widget FossilVolcanicMine.TIME text "0:01"
tick 300
widget FossilVolcanicMine.TIME text "0:00"
tick
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Oh dear, you are dead!"
tick
# Back at the entrance, dead: the eruption.
close FossilVolcanicMine.TIME
scene 3760 3760
at 3812 3808
npc FOSSIL_MINEGUARD "Petrified Pete" 3815 3812 as pete
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_PROGRESS_STATUS 0
tick 4
expect saved.volcanic.kept ~ ",1500,0,1,e"
expect stat.Points = "10,500"
expect goal.note ~ "2 packs affordable now. 1,500 points to the next pack"

# Spending at the shop: the balance read again.
widget FossilVolcanicShop.POINTS text "Points: 2,500"
tick
close FossilVolcanicShop.POINTS
tick
expect stat.Points = "2,500"
# Access paid for good: straight in.
expect step = "Enter the Volcanic Mine"
expect detail = "Your access is paid for good"

# A game ended by logging out.
scene 3760 10140
at 3800 10190
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_PROGRESS_STATUS 2
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_TEMP_PTS 0
tick
varbit FOSSIL_MINE_TEMP_PTS 406
tick 180
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
expect saved.volcanic.kept ~ ",406,0,1,o"
